    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n33440" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">pălĕa</span></b> , ae,
			f.
		kindred with Sanscr. pala, stramen; cf.: pollen, pulvis, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παλύνω</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>chaff</i>, <i><span class="en">Varr.
				R. R. 1, 50 <i>fin.</i></span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">surgentem ad Zephyrum paleae jactantur inanes,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 3, 134</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 18, 30, 72, § 297</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Col. 2, 9,
				15</span></i>; <i><span class="en">6, 2,
			3</span></i>; <i><span class="en">7, 3, 22
			al.</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Vulg. Matt. 3,
			12</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<b>Transf.</b>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Dross</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">palea aeris,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					34, 13, 36, § 134</span></i>
			. —</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>The wattles</i> or <i>gills</i> of a
			cock, <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 3, 9, 5</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Col. 8, 2,
			9</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>C.</b>
			<i>Straw</i>, <i><span class="en">Vulg. Judic. 19,
				19</span></i>; <i><span class="en">id. Isa. 11, 7</span></i>.</div>
